<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Profil Dokter</title>
<style>
body {
font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
background-color: #f4f6f9;
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
align-items: center;
height: 100vh;
margin: 0;
}
.card {
background: #ffffff;
width: 420px;
padding: 25px;
border-radius: 12px;
box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
text-align: center;
}
img.foto {
width: 160px;
height: auto;
border-radius: 10px;
margin-bottom: 15px;
}
h2 {
margin: 10px 0 5px 0;
}
p {
margin: 6px 0;
font-size: 14px;
}
.label {
font-weight: bold;
}
.qr {
margin-top: 15px;
}
.footer {
margin-top: 15px;
font-size: 12px;
color: gray;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="card">

<!-- Ganti nama file foto sesuai file upload -->
<img src="foto-dr-ismawanty.png" class="foto" alt="Foto Dokter">

<h2>dr. Ismawanty Mustain, Sp.OG., M.Kes., MARS.</h2>

<p><span class="label">SIP:</span> ISI NOMOR SIP</p>
<p><span class="label">STR:</span> ISI NOMOR STR</p>
<p><span class="label">Berlaku sampai:</span> ISI TANGGAL BERLAKU</p>
<p><span class="label">Tempat Praktik:</span><br>
Klinik Utama Budi Medika Pomalaa</p>

<div class="qr">
<h3>QR Profil Dokter</h3>
<img src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=150x150&data=https://klinikbmpomalaa-ship-it.github.io/profil-dokter/dr-ismawanty.html" alt="QR Profil">
</div>

<div class="footer">
Profil Resmi Dokter – Klinik Utama Budi Medika Pomalaa
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
